  "referenceNumber": "MYA0049",
  "remarks": "\nThe Myanmar Armed Forces have a track record of committing serious human rights violations and violations of international humanitarian law in Myanmar for decades.\nMyanmar New Era Trading Ltd has been responsible for the supply of parts and upkeep of aircraft for the Myanmar Armed Forces. Therefore, Myanmar New Era Trading Ltd has been involved in the supply of restricted goods to Myanmar.\n",
